<BaseLayout title="About Daniel's Lock & Key | Hollywood" description="Learn about Daniel's owner-operated service approach, California locksmith-company license, and clear service limits."><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="kicker">Owner-operated in Los Angeles</p><h1>A locksmith conversation with Daniel.</h1><p class="lede">Daniel's site is designed to explain the problem, options, and next step without invented timing or pricing.</p></div></section><section class="section shell detail"><div><h2>Public business verification</h2><p>{site.license}. The California DCA/BSIS record reviewed for this site shows the company license current through December 31, 2027.</p><h2>Clear service limits</h2><p>Vehicle service is authorized passenger-vehicle lockout entry only. No replacement keys, fobs, transponders, programming, or ignition work are advertised.</p></div><aside><h2>Talk to Daniel</h2><a class="pill" href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>{site.phone}</a></aside></section></BaseLayout>
